cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "OIN-SMILES"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for lossless conversion between 3D XYZ molecular structures and
  1D SMILES strings for Transition Metal Complexes (TMCs). Implements Open Isomer
  Notation (OIN) v3.7 — encoding coordination geometry, slot assignments, hapticity,
  winding direction, and P/N stereochemistry for exact 3D reconstruction.
authors:
  - given-names: Thomas
    family-names: Mustard
    alias: tjmustard
license: MIT
version: "0.3.4"
date-released: "2026-07-07"
keywords:
  - transition metal complexes
  - SMILES
  - Open Isomer Notation
  - cheminformatics
  - stereochemistry
  - molecular structure
  - xyz2mol
